{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-40","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":40,"points":null,"unitId":"development","unitLabel":"발생·분화","topic":"발생·배아·난할","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["development","gene","reproduction","enzyme"],"stem":"초파리발생에서Bicoid, Caudal, Hunchback, Nanos는앞-뒤축\n(anterior-posterior axis)의형성에중요한역할을하는형태형성\n요소(morphogen)이다. 그림은발생단계에따른이4가지유전자\n산물의분포변화를나타낸것이다.\n(가) 난자\n(나) 초기난할배아\n(다) 후기난할배아\n위의그림에대한설명이나추론으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. Nanos 단백질은hunchback mRNA의번역을억제할것이다.\nㄴ. 난할이진행되면서Bicoid 단백질은핵내hunchback\n유전자의전사를촉진할것이다.\nㄷ. Caudal 단백질은수정후nanos mRNA의번역을촉진하여\n뒤쪽구조의형성을시작하게할것이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":467,"height":256,"region":0,"bbox":[71.955,99.86,186.8,102.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-40/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":470,"height":256,"region":0,"bbox":[71.155,230.66,188.0,102.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-40/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":469,"height":255,"region":0,"bbox":[70.355,361.46,187.6,102.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-40/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":772,"height":264,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,522.26,308.8,105.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t010","t011","t012","t013","t